Preserve the native header layout in isolated woodworking builds

The five-stage 72d gate passed kernel-only compilation and failed at definition_sources.h because its explicit ../native/document.h include was copied into a flat isolated-woodworking directory. Keep W under isolated-woodworking/native so actual repository includes resolve without rewriting headers or compiler flags. Test counts unchanged; the failed 72d receipt remains unchanged and all focused259 methods remain UNRUN.
